{"4546540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Afterlight", "steam_appid": 4546540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/186d698bc293fda4d13c28d05e89143d.avif?t=1788227050\" width=1560 height=400 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world you knew is gone. Nature has reclaimed the roads, the power grids have long since failed, and the dead outnumber the living a thousand to one. What's left of this place is yours now. Survive it alone, or drag three friends down with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quick Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-player online <strong>co-op</strong> - survive with up to three friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted <strong>open world</strong> of dense mountain forests, decaying towns, and abandoned research facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic <strong>day/night </strong>cycle - horde attacks every single night, escalating in size and aggression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two types of <strong>infected</strong> - Day walkers you can manage. Night infected you need to outthink. Faster, harder to kill, and repelled by light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather system</strong> - fog and storms roll in without warning, and anything that limits your visibility after dark can get you killed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B<strong>ase building and fortification</strong> system - construct and reinforce your defenses before nightfall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge, repair, and <strong>drive</strong> vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiered <strong>loot system</strong> - better gear hidden in more dangerous locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full survival <strong>simulation</strong> - manage hunger, thirst, injuries, and stamina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt</strong> <strong>wildlife</strong> and scavenge the land to stay fed and supplied</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree <strong>progression</strong> - grow stronger the longer you survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade</strong> with NPC survivors scattered across the county</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4-Player Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive with up to three friends. Share the scavenging, the building, and the fight. Just don't count on all of them making it back before dark.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/f8799399eba84f4d0b7c2ba586c4c151.poster.avif?t=1788227050\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/f8799399eba84f4d0b7c2ba586c4c151.webm?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/f8799399eba84f4d0b7c2ba586c4c151.mp4?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vast open world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handcrafted open world spanning dense mountain forests, crumbling infrastructure, and overgrown ruins. A decade after the collapse, nature is slowly reclaiming what civilization left behind, but the abandoned research facilities still litter the mountainside, silent and waiting. Every location tells a story. Not all of them have endings yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/d9e9d9e87bcc9f9181674e48b249c52f.poster.avif?t=1788227050\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/d9e9d9e87bcc9f9181674e48b249c52f.webm?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/d9e9d9e87bcc9f9181674e48b249c52f.mp4?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Day. Dread the Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daylight belongs to the living, barely. Use every hour to scavenge, build, and prepare. When darkness falls, the horde descends on your position without fail. The infected that roam during the day are dangerous. The ones that come out at night are something else entirely, mutated, faster, and harder to put down. Every dawn you survive is borrowed time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/f09b65fcddeade1b3d0158441e613f6d.poster.avif?t=1788227050\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/f09b65fcddeade1b3d0158441e613f6d.webm?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/f09b65fcddeade1b3d0158441e613f6d.mp4?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Fortify, and Hold the Line</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base is the only thing standing between you and the horde. Scavenge materials, construct walls and defenses, and reinforce your position night after night. What you build, and how well you build it, determines whether you see morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/783ab6ecc6dd6bfcaf167196c03bda96.poster.avif?t=1788227050\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/783ab6ecc6dd6bfcaf167196c03bda96.webm?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/783ab6ecc6dd6bfcaf167196c03bda96.mp4?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot, Craft, and Gear Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supplies are scarce and spread thin across a sprawling open world. Scavenge abandoned towns and facilities, and push into dangerous territory for higher-tier loot. Craft weapons, tools, and equipment from what you find, and manage your hunger, thirst, and injuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/ffd67e1e287ea53f90f0f5b876716ae9.poster.avif?t=1788227050\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/ffd67e1e287ea53f90f0f5b876716ae9.webm?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/ffd67e1e287ea53f90f0f5b876716ae9.mp4?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world you knew is gone. Nature has reclaimed the roads, the power grids have long since failed, and the dead outnumber the living a thousand to one. What's left of this place is yours now. Survive it alone, or drag three friends down with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quick Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-player online <strong>co-op</strong> - survive with up to three friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted <strong>open world</strong> of dense mountain forests, decaying towns, and abandoned research facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic <strong>day/night </strong>cycle - horde attacks every single night, escalating in size and aggression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two types of <strong>infected</strong> - Day walkers you can manage. Night infected you need to outthink. Faster, harder to kill, and repelled by light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather system</strong> - fog and storms roll in without warning, and anything that limits your visibility after dark can get you killed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B<strong>ase building and fortification</strong> system - construct and reinforce your defenses before nightfall</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge, repair, and <strong>drive</strong> vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiered <strong>loot system</strong> - better gear hidden in more dangerous locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full survival <strong>simulation</strong> - manage hunger, thirst, injuries, and stamina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt</strong> <strong>wildlife</strong> and scavenge the land to stay fed and supplied</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree <strong>progression</strong> - grow stronger the longer you survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade</strong> with NPC survivors scattered across the county</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4-Player Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive with up to three friends. Share the scavenging, the building, and the fight. Just don't count on all of them making it back before dark.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/f8799399eba84f4d0b7c2ba586c4c151.poster.avif?t=1788227050\" width=1170 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/f8799399eba84f4d0b7c2ba586c4c151.webm?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/f8799399eba84f4d0b7c2ba586c4c151.mp4?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vast open world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handcrafted open world spanning dense mountain forests, crumbling infrastructure, and overgrown ruins. A decade after the collapse, nature is slowly reclaiming what civilization left behind, but the abandoned research facilities still litter the mountainside, silent and waiting. Every location tells a story. Not all of them have endings yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/d9e9d9e87bcc9f9181674e48b249c52f.poster.avif?t=1788227050\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/d9e9d9e87bcc9f9181674e48b249c52f.webm?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/d9e9d9e87bcc9f9181674e48b249c52f.mp4?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Day. Dread the Night</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daylight belongs to the living, barely. Use every hour to scavenge, build, and prepare. When darkness falls, the horde descends on your position without fail. The infected that roam during the day are dangerous. The ones that come out at night are something else entirely, mutated, faster, and harder to put down. Every dawn you survive is borrowed time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/f09b65fcddeade1b3d0158441e613f6d.poster.avif?t=1788227050\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/f09b65fcddeade1b3d0158441e613f6d.webm?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/f09b65fcddeade1b3d0158441e613f6d.mp4?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Fortify, and Hold the Line</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base is the only thing standing between you and the horde. Scavenge materials, construct walls and defenses, and reinforce your position night after night. What you build, and how well you build it, determines whether you see morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/783ab6ecc6dd6bfcaf167196c03bda96.poster.avif?t=1788227050\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/783ab6ecc6dd6bfcaf167196c03bda96.webm?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/783ab6ecc6dd6bfcaf167196c03bda96.mp4?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot, Craft, and Gear Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supplies are scarce and spread thin across a sprawling open world. Scavenge abandoned towns and facilities, and push into dangerous territory for higher-tier loot. Craft weapons, tools, and equipment from what you find, and manage your hunger, thirst, and injuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/ffd67e1e287ea53f90f0f5b876716ae9.poster.avif?t=1788227050\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/ffd67e1e287ea53f90f0f5b876716ae9.webm?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/extras/ffd67e1e287ea53f90f0f5b876716ae9.mp4?t=1788227050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Afterlight is an open-world sandbox survival horror game combining base-building, crafting, and tower defense. Hunt for supplies by day. Build your defenses and outlast the horde when night falls, solo or co-op. The virus was planned. You're the loose end.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/decbf0372c718aaadb247fe514d71350fc0b0d9c/header.jpg?t=1788227050", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/324a42418ba7fb7d8a1122fc48612c3f4f32c691/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788227050", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4546540/324a42418ba7fb7d8a1122fc48612c3f4f32c691/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788227050", "website": "https://afterlightstudios.ca/games/game_mrxfm2oq45t", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit proce